{"version":1,"content":"<p>組合草蜢昨晚於舉行《THREE IN LOVE演唱會 - 澳門站》尾場，座無虛席，3人一登場，便連續唱跳18分鐘，展現驚人體力，在唱到《愛將》前，3人特別望向天空，向音樂恩師梅艷芳致敬。</p><p>蔡一智感性表示：「因為沒有梅艷芳，就沒有草蜢。</p><p>」他回憶</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:41:12.961890+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:04:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:38:05.788202+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:38:05.788202+00:00","content_hash":"866c0e52d3304948af716c2b260892d11c53e684b985a61f4f795e96246af7dc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}